"relationship": "same_topic",
"comparison": "Both Microsoft and Citigroup detail the specific composition and expertise of the bodies providing oversight. Microsoft's disclosure states that 'The CIO and the Head of NFR CTIS report on the status of our Cybersecurity Program... to the FRC, the BOTC and the Board' (ms_2024_7_P399_S004), implying a structured reporting line from technical leadership to the Board. Citigroup similarly notes that 'Citi's Board includes members with cybersecurity expertise and experience' (c_2024_7_P587_S002) to provide oversight. Both disclosures highlight the integration of specialized technical or cybersecurity expertise within the governance structure responsible for overseeing cybersecurity risk.",
